# Build output. Not tracked: the deploy script runs `npm ci && npm run build` and packs
# from the fresh output, so nothing installs from the checkout. Committing it also meant
# every rebuild changed the bundle's content hash and raised a new code-scanning alert
# against the vendored library code inside it.
dist/

